%abc-2.1
% Melody, chords and words transcribed by hand from the writer's own lead sheet,
% sources/sheetPdf.pdf (larryholdermusic.org/scores/fordad_C.pdf), bar for bar. Bar
% numbers match the PDF. The piano left hand and the inner voices are not transcribed;
% the rolled closing chord is reduced to its top note.
% Checked against sources/tune.mid (tools/check-abc-midi.py). The MIDI is a single piano
% track with the melody an octave up on top; read that way it agrees with the PDF note for
% note. It differs only in form: it plays the verse section once more than the PDF, so the
% PDF's form wins.
X:1
T:For Dad
C:Words and Music by Lawrence Keith Holder
Z:Transcribed from the writer's lead sheet (2003)
M:4/4
L:1/8
K:C
